{"steam_appid":3195580,"steam_name":"lily's world XD","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3195580/1254232657/3c4f52535ae6c885356fd0a31b86c28ea5e90333/1789490300/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1789656759","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257425840/96ec292b7ef34461d5f3cdcae6331e7ae7ea3700/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1789656759","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195580/103a30be6ccc9d33c768af74f93605aac596aca7/ss_103a30be6ccc9d33c768af74f93605aac596aca7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789656828","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195580/ae8c6c4b00e1bd125a3476912bb0246fa194a1f1/ss_ae8c6c4b00e1bd125a3476912bb0246fa194a1f1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789656828","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195580/a813b71e9cb56ad4613d3577b6f576581ec8b284/ss_a813b71e9cb56ad4613d3577b6f576581ec8b284.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789656828","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195580/416ae854dcf371797835f2ad3019dea8ca1ae8d6/ss_416ae854dcf371797835f2ad3019dea8ca1ae8d6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789656828","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195580/2af1dd8bbe0dc21f0dbb3b41bb9b57444b7d1f3c/ss_2af1dd8bbe0dc21f0dbb3b41bb9b57444b7d1f3c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789656828"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195580/extras/a6d1a61e91313e6f9b22ad4ed6989c2b.poster.avif?t=1789656828\" aria-label=\"Welcome to lily&#039;s world XD\" width=1170 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195580/extras/a6d1a61e91313e6f9b22ad4ed6989c2b.webm?t=1789656828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195580/extras/a6d1a61e91313e6f9b22ad4ed6989c2b.mp4?t=1789656828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lily is a typical teenage girl — dramatic, emotional, awkward — but she’s hiding a secret, and her laptop holds the key. Your explorations into this stranger’s life soon reveal a dark truth, but your actions won’t stay unnoticed for long. Can you find Lily before those who took her find you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195580/extras/3a032ed632dda8f958b9fd128b83e96d.poster.avif?t=1789656828\" aria-label=\"Montage of a mouse cursor maze, a password being entered, an IM chat, and a girl&#039;s blog post\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195580/extras/3a032ed632dda8f958b9fd128b83e96d.webm?t=1789656828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195580/extras/3a032ed632dda8f958b9fd128b83e96d.mp4?t=1789656828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">˚₊‧꒰ა DIVE INTO THE EARLY WEB ໒꒱ ‧₊˚</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lily’s laptop is full of clues to her whereabouts. Comb through her blog, decode hidden messages and reconnect with her childhood friends to piece together her story. Lily wasn’t the only one with something to hide: other forces are at work to stop you, and even your own computer isn’t safe from intrusion…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195580/extras/336d3506642324f1e2ac0f4455be9d15.poster.avif?t=1789656828\" aria-label=\"Three photos of a teenage girl. Occasionally they flicker with a glitch effect\" width=1170 height=514 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195580/extras/336d3506642324f1e2ac0f4455be9d15.webm?t=1789656828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195580/extras/336d3506642324f1e2ac0f4455be9d15.mp4?t=1789656828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">⊹₊˚‧︵‿₊୨ AUTHENTIC CRINGE ୧₊‿︵‧˚₊⊹</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >lily’s world XD tells a story of friendship, body image and how it feels to grow up as a lonely nerd online, featuring real photos of the developer and her friends’ teenage selves and the vocal talents of LilyPichu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195580/extras/96d9294a40d657669bf59da902e8e5d3.poster.avif?t=1789656828\" aria-label=\"An advert for &#039;Web Watch&#039; monitoring software, which flickers to and from a logo for &#039;The Radiant Path&#039;\" width=296 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195580/extras/96d9294a40d657669bf59da902e8e5d3.webm?t=1789656828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195580/extras/96d9294a40d657669bf59da902e8e5d3.mp4?t=1789656828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.8 GHz or faster processor<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Direct X 9.0c compatible video card<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> windows 10 or 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.8 GHz or faster processor<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Direct X 9.0c compatible video card<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Casual","Indie"],"developers":["SonderingEmily"],"publishers":["Kwalee"],"release_date":"Sep 17, 2026"}